    <summary>
                Defines the behavior of EF Core regarding the management of Cosmos DB session tokens.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
                See <see href="https://aka.ms/efcore-docs-cosmos-session">Cosmos session consistency</see> for more info.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
